# Production build configuration for the documentation site.
#
# `vitepress build` runs in Vite's `production` mode, where `.env.production`
# outranks any `.env` beside it. The real file is NOT committed: it used to be,
# carrying wafflebase's own Google Analytics property, so every fork and
# self-host that ran `pnpm build:all` reported its visitors into it.
#
# Copy this to `.env.production` (git-ignored) or supply the value as an
# environment variable on the build command. Leaving it unset is a valid
# choice — no gtag.js is emitted and the site sends no analytics anywhere.
#
# wafflebase.io supplies this from the `VITE_GA_ID` repository variable in
# .github/workflows/publish-ghpage.yml.

VITE_GA_ID=
